  "ig_caption": "While you were sleeping, this workflow made me $12K. Here's exactly how it's built. 💸\n\n3AM. Lead hits the form. N8N kicks in. Claude reads the message, qualifies the lead, drafts a personalised reply in my tone, then GoHighLevel books the call straight into my calendar. I woke up to a $12K deal already half-closed. ☕️\n\nThe old way: chase leads for days, lose them to faster competitors, burn out.\nThe new way: systems that sell while you sleep.\n\nSound familiar? If you're still manually replying to leads in 2025, you're leaving serious money on the table. DM me 'SLEEP' and I'll show you how we'd build this for your business. 🚀\n\n#AIAutomation #N8N #GoHighLevel #BusinessAutomation #Entrepreneur #ClaudeAI #LeadGeneration #SalesFunnel #DigitalMarketing #AIAgency #WorkflowAutomation #PassiveIncome #ScaleYourBusiness #SmallBusinessTips #MarketingAutomation #SaaS #TechStartup #AITools #BusinessGrowth #SolopreneurLife #AutomationNation #FutureOfWork #ContentCreator #Accelod #BuildInPublic",
  "fb_caption": "While you were sleeping, this workflow made me $12K. Here's exactly how it's built. 💸\n\nPicture this: 3AM. A lead fills out the form. N8N triggers instantly. Claude AI reads the enquiry, qualifies the lead against my criteria, and drafts a personalised reply that sounds exactly like me. GoHighLevel then books the call straight into my calendar and sends the confirmation.\n\nI woke up to a $12K deal already halfway closed. No chasing. No back-and-forth. No missed opportunities.\n\nThe old way: manually reply to leads, lose them to faster competitors, burn out trying to keep up.\nThe new way: intelligent systems that qualify, respond, and convert while you sleep.\n\nSound familiar? If you're still manually handling every lead in 2025, you're leaving serious money on the table. Comment 'SLEEP' or DM me and I'll walk you through how we'd build this exact system for your business. 🚀\n\n#AIAutomation #N8N #GoHighLevel #BusinessAutomation #Entrepreneur #ClaudeAI #LeadGeneration #SalesFunnel #DigitalMarketing #AIAgency #WorkflowAutomation #PassiveIncome #ScaleYourBusiness #SmallBusinessTips #MarketingAutomation #SaaS #TechStartup #AITools #BusinessGrowth #SolopreneurLife #AutomationNation #FutureOfWork #Accelod #BuildInPublic",
